{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the rhythm of the music and step into a world where every shot is driven by the beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Rhythm of Annihilation</i>, every shot, dodge, and skill must land perfectly on the beat to unleash its full power. The game features a variety of unique levels, each with its own music theme, enemy patterns, and stage mechanics, keeping every challenge fresh and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face endless waves of enemies and powerful, uniquely designed bosses\u2014each battle feels like a song that keeps building in intensity, syncing your actions with your heartbeat. Mastering rhythm is as important as mastering aim, turning music into your second weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re shooting in perfect sync, chasing flawless combos, or challenging the toughest stages, <i>Rhythm of Annihilation</i> delivers a one-of-a-kind audiovisual experience!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3909700?t=1759672533","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909700/ef173342065a8b3baf417521b094b3f60fd13c3c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759672533","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909700/8808ef0b884e7a47436e57b6d86783b6cbb3de9c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759672533","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909700/8808ef0b884e7a47436e57b6d86783b6cbb3de9c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759672533","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":4017650,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow the rhythm of the music and step into a world where every shot is driven by the beat!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Rhythm of Annihilation</i>, every shot, dodge, and skill must land perfectly on the beat to unleash its full power. The game features a variety of unique levels, each with its own music theme, enemy patterns, and stage mechanics, keeping every challenge fresh and exciting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face endless waves of enemies and powerful, uniquely designed bosses\u2014each battle feels like a song that keeps building in intensity, syncing your actions with your heartbeat. Mastering rhythm is as important as mastering aim, turning music into your second weapon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you\u2019re shooting in perfect sync, chasing flawless combos, or challenging the toughest stages, <i>Rhythm of Annihilation</i> delivers a one-of-a-kind audiovisual experience!</p>","developers":["\u5341\u5e74"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3909700/8ac1eeed48d10504980ea414798210b21f439c2a/header.jpg?t=1759672533","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3909700/981494274/a6a44dc0020e5071bdfa1e8cfe57b747b6549d7d/1759586824/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759610632","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3909700/981494274/a6a44dc0020e5071bdfa1e8cfe57b747b6549d7d/1759586824/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759610632","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3909700/981494274/a6a44dc0020e5071bdfa1e8cfe57b747b6549d7d/1759586824/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1759610632","id":257174410,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamst